{"ID":"20240118151018-5p9ibxy","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151018-5p9ibxy","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151018-5p9ibxy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151018-q153qk3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122152159-pqegme0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122152159-pqegme0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:36,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:36\u0026#125;","title":"279蛇含蛇合280恒山","type":"doc","updated":"20240122152203"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151018-q153qk3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151018-q153qk3","updated":"20240122152121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蛇含"}]},{"ID":"20240122152122-v5o22n2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152122-v5o22n2","updated":"20240122152125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名蛇衔。味苦，微寒，无毒。治惊痫，寒热邪气，除热，金疮，疽，痔，鼠瘰，恶疮，头疡。生山谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152127-018p7gk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152127-018p7gk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产山野之地，处处有之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152129-z218s6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152129-z218s6s"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，微寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152130-bkd8ovs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152130-bkd8ovs"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】蛇含草主治痈疮，蛇咬，清热解毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152132-iow5lj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152132-iow5lj8"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗心腹邪气，腹痛湿痹，养胎，利小儿。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152134-3r97nks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152134-3r97nks"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治小儿寒热丹疹。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152135-24g7sm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152135-24g7sm8"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一至二钱，外用无定量。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152137-o7xm9mc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152137-o7xm9mc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】忌火。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152126-tffq1jx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152126-tffq1jx"}},{"ID":"20240122152137-px4vlwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152137-px4vlwa","updated":"20240122152142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二百七十九，这个是“蛇含”。这个蛇含草呢，现在用得也不多，一般药房买不到，诸位看过有这么一样东西，蛇含草主治蛇咬啊，清热解毒的剂药。"}]},{"ID":"20240122152137-8t6w3ig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152137-8t6w3ig"}},{"ID":"20240122152148-1ryjig9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152148-1ryjig9","updated":"20240122152152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"恒山"}]},{"ID":"20240122152153-wstwq6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152153-wstwq6n","updated":"20240122152159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名玄草。味苦，寒，有毒。治伤寒寒热，发温疟，鬼毒，胸中痰结，吐逆。生川谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152159-pqegme0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152159-pqegme0","updated":"20240122152203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"像二百八十，恒山，我们也用得不多，现在很多药，也不是，认不得这个药了。"}]}]}